  "raw_text": "\n\nBrowse Program Information\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAcademic Program:\tB.Sc. in Gerontology\nAcademic Year:\t2024\nLanguage:\t\nEnglish\nSimplified Chinese\nTraditional Chinese\n\n\n\nLearning Outcomes\nStudy Scheme\n \n\n\t\n\nGerontology\n\nApplicable to students admitted in 2024-25\n\n\t\n\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\nMajor Programme Requirement (for Associate Degree or Higher Diploma holders admitted to senior-year places)\n\n \n\n\t\n\n \n\n\n\n\nStudents are required to complete a minimum of 52 units of courses as follows:\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\t\n\n \n\n\t\n\nUnits\n\n\n\n\n1.\n\n\t\n\nRequired Courses:\n\n\t\n\n46 \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\t\n\nGRON3111, 3112, 3113, 3114, 3211, 3213, 3214, 3311, 4212, 4312 (capstone course), PHPC1001#, 1017#, 2015#, 2017#, 3015#\n\n\t\n\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\t\n\n \n\n\t\n\n \n\n\n\n\n2.\n\n\t\n\nElective Courses:\n\n\t\n\n6\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\t\n\nTwo courses chosen from the following:\n\n\t\n\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\t\n\nCHPR4012#, GRON3412, 4101, 4102, 4411, PHPC2007#, 2020#, 4025#, 4033#\n\n\t\n\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\t\n\nTotal:\n\n\t\n\n52\n\n\n\n\n \n\nExplanatory Notes:\n\n\n\n\n1.\n\n\t\n\nGRON courses at 2000 and above level as well as those labeled as # will be included in the calculation of Major GPA for honours classification.\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\t\n\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n\t\n\nRecommended Course Pattern\n\n\t\n\nUnits\n\n\n\n\nFirst Year of\n\nAttendance\n\n\t\n\n1st term\n\nMajor Required: GRON3112, 3211, PHPC1001, 2015, 2017\n\nMajor Elective(s):\n\n\t\n\n \n\n14\n\n\n\n\n2nd term\n\nMajor Required: GRON3111, 3113, 3213, 3311, PHPC1017\n\nMajor Elective(s):\n\n\t\n\n \n\n13\n\n \n\n\n\n\nSecond Year of\n\nAttendance\n\n\t\n\n1st term\n\nMajor Required: GRON3114, 4312\n\nMajor Elective(s):\n\n\t\n\n \n\n11\n\n \n\n\n\n\n2nd term\n\nMajor Required: GRON3214, 4212, PHPC3015\n\nMajor Elective(s): 2 courses\n\n\t\n\n \n\n8\n\n6\n\n\n\n\nTotal:\n\n\t\n\n52\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\t\n\n \n\n\n\n\nCourse List\n\n\n\n\nCourse Code\n\n\t\n\nCourse Title\n\